    title: "Storytelling: Plot, Character, Setting",
    duration: "10–15 min",
    hook: "Humans are the only species that tells stories. We've been doing it around fires for hundreds of thousands of years. Stories are how we make sense of the world, pass down wisdom, process difficult experiences, build empathy, and connect with others. Every movie, book, game, and song you love is a story. And learning how stories work gives you the power to create them.",
